 "answer_verbatim": "**My pick: Seever & Sons Tire** for installation. It’s a local Pleasanton shop with strong review signals: Yelp shows **4.8/5 from 531 reviews**, and customers mention helpful service even for tires they didn’t buy there. That makes it a good first call if you care most about the shop experience.\n\nFor buying tires, compare its out-the-door quote with **Big Brand Tire** on Old Santa Rita Road, which lists **4.7/5 from 709 reviews**. Ask both for the same tire model and confirm the quote includes mounting, balancing, disposal, and any alignment check.\n\n**Best value/convenience alternative:** Costco Tire Center on Johnson Drive, especially if you’re a member and its tire price is competitive. **Big O Tires** is another local option for buying and installation.\n\nI’d call ahead to confirm stock, appointment availability, and the full installed price—ratings and prices can change.",
